Mine Mayhem v2.90 - Minesweeper for DOS.
Three styles of minefields.  Cross the
minefield as well as clear it.	Auto-
matically open and/or mark squares.
Records the ten fastest times and 3BV/s.
Custom games are remembered.  Random
games.	Wrap-around option.
Optional sound effects.
Freeware, source available.
386+, 2 Meg, VESA SVGA, Mouse.
